@baseUrl = http://localhost:4010
@token = tok_acme_admin

### the same DTO shape across single and list responses
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/tenants/ten_acme/products/prd_tee
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### pagination fields use the same names everywhere
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/tenants/ten_acme/products?limit=2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### every error uses the same problem members
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/tenants/ten_acme/products/prd_missing
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### the same query parameter spelling is used on customers
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/tenants/ten_acme/customers?limit=2&sort=name&includeTotal=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
